WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.492
Escape implies speed.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.968
In one dimension traps let a walker escape

3
00:00:04.968 --> 00:00:07.136
at zero speed. Not in two or more?

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.562
Cut the path at record moments; each piece has finite average length.

5
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.963
Claimed: escaping forces a positive speed.

6
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:18.846
Checked in Lean.
